==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 18~22.67 seconds<sup>540f~680f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 11.33 seconds<sup>340f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since this stage is filled with just [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel Enemies]], using any of the [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|Anti-Angel Cats]] will easily clear this stage.

